              "blocks": {
                "text_JifGYE": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>At Eden Raine, every lab-grown diamond engagement ring is designed to celebrate your unique love story. Since 2005, we have been committed to offering a thoughtful, modern alternative to traditional diamond jewellery – one that combines timeless beauty with exceptional craftsmanship and lasting value.<br/></p><p>Our friendly, non-commissioned jewellery experts are available for free consultations to help you explore designs or create a custom ring. Every Eden Raine lab-grown diamond engagement ring includes free shipping within the USA, free 30-day returns, and one complimentary resizing.<br/><br/>Celebrate your once-in-a-lifetime moment with a lab-grown diamond engagement ring crafted to last, made to be loved, and designed to reflect the beauty of your commitment.<br/><br/></p>",
